 "description": "Create one printable sheet and editable share link from plain label text. Does not submit a physical print job or save account data. Returns printUrl, editUrl, and importable sheet JSON. Rejects overflow. Positions are 1-based, row-major; copies repeats each label consecutively. Use empty strings for blank slots.",
